    "official": "official-match counts differ (757, 767, 769) -> said as 'around 760'",
    "ronaldo": "passed 900 official career goals in September 2024"
  },
  "images": {
    "pele": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/pele.png",
    "ronaldo": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/ronaldo.png",
    "maracana1969": "file:///home/user/Tierlist/tools/video-factory/work/ex-people/maracana1969.png"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "How many goals did Pelé really score?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "hook": true,
        "bg": "yellow",
        "scale": 1.3,
        "person": {
          "image": "pele",
          "hairStyle": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Guinness World Records says one thousand, two hundred and seventy-nine.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "counter",
        "bg": "green",
        "from": 0,
        "to": 1279,
        "comma": true,
        "word": "GOALS",
        "size": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In one thousand, three hundred and sixty-three games.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "counter",
        "bg": "green",
        "from": 0,
        "to": 1363,
        "comma": true,
        "word": "GAMES",
        "size": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He even celebrated his thousandth: a penalty at the Maracanã, in November 1969.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "picture",
        "image": "maracana1969",
        "bg": "blue",
        "label": "GOAL 1,000 · 1969"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But here's the catch.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "yellow",
        "person": {
          "image": "pele"
        },
        "name": "PELÉ"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That total counts friendlies and exhibition tours too.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "ledger",
        "bg": "orange",
        "title": "FRIENDLIES",
        "title2": "TOURS"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Count only official matches, and it's around seven hundred and sixty.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "counter",
        "bg": "orange",
        "from": 1279,
        "to": 760,
        "comma": true,
        "word": "OFFICIAL GOALS · ROUGHLY",
        "size": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And that changes who football's top scorer is.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "red",
        "person": false,
        "stamp": "RECOUNT"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Because Cristiano Ronaldo passed nine hundred official goals back in 2024.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "red",
        "person": {
          "image": "ronaldo",
          "hairStyle": "short",
          "back": true
        },
        "name": "CRISTIANO RONALDO · 900+"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So who's the top scorer? Count everything, it's Pelé. Count only official games, it's Ronaldo.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "bg": "purple",
        "left": {
          "image": "pele"
        },
        "leftNum": "1,279",
        "leftName": "EVERY GAME",
        "right": {
          "image": "ronaldo",
          "back": true
        },
        "rightNum": "900+",
        "rightName": "OFFICIAL ONLY"
      }
    }
  ]
}